      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "The same problem, and it seems that all controllers're the same, in addition, when I uncheck VIVE ADVANCED CONTROL (yeh, when it's unchecked, animation can work smoothly) and checked back, the finger animation will not work any more, change the avatar doesn't do any thing, it only can be returned when I change the world. \nhttps://youtu.be/_uFvU7gXM88\nAlso a video shows what I say.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
