      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Just take a note: IMO, first, the triggers of the VIVE Controller Model in the vid are looks work fine and smooth, which means it's not issue with SteamVR input, SteamVR already send the correct trigger value and VRChat also receive it correctly. second, changing avatar doesn't do anything, it means that it's not a new avatar animator system's issue.\nThere're all things I know now.",
      "viewerReactions": null
