      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "On Oculus Touch controllers trigger still behaves like before, I can smoothly close/open my hand, so it's not an universal issue. It is specific to Vive wands and maybe possibly also Index(?).",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
    {
