      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "The main bug (GestureRightWeight/GestureLeftWeight falls to 0 by releasing the trigger) still occurs in the current build 984.\nUpdate on the second issue:\nThis is not a VRChat bug. It can be fixed by removing the \"Loop Time\" flag on the animation itsef.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
