  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Before AV3 Update:\nFist: pressing the trigger opens the hand smoothly between closed and open. Also the ears can be moved on some avatars.\nAfter AV3 Update:\nFist: now, the trigger has the states 0 or 1. It's not anymore possible to open a hand or rotate ears smoothly, like before.\nThis can be reproduced with old avatars (which worked before) and also with new 3.0 avatars. Also, in the new debug menu, the GestureRightWeight/GestureLeftWeight shows not values between 0 and 1).",
